>> title: Jambalaya
>> category: Rice, Beans & Grains
>> tags: rice, sausage, chicken, creole, one-pot
>> counters: Meat and Three, One Pot
>> servings: 6
>> time: 1 hr 15 min
>> washing-up: the Dutch oven

>> step: brown 10 min
Brown @andouille sausage{12%oz}(340 g; sliced) and @chicken thighs{1%lb}(450 g; cut in 1-in pieces) in a #Dutch oven{} for ~{10%min}.

>> step: sweat 8 min
Sweat @&(~1)meat{} with @yellow onion{1%large}, @green bell pepper{1}, @celery{2%ribs}, and @garlic{3%cloves} for ~{8%min}.

>> step: toast 2 min
Toast @&(~1)base{} with @long-grain white rice{2%cups}(400 g) and @Cajun seasoning{1%Tbs} for ~{2%min}.

>> step: simmer covered 25 min
Simmer @&(~1)rice{} covered over low heat for ~{25%min} with @canned crushed tomatoes{14%oz}(400 g), @chicken stock{2%cups}(475 mL), and @kosher salt{1 1/2%tsp}.

>> step: rest 10 min, fold in
Rest @&(~1)jambalaya{} off the heat for ~{10%min}, then fold in @scallions{4}(sliced).
